      "title": "University Published Paper Reproducibility Assessment Protocol - For students v1",
      "abstract": "<p>This protocol is for students carrying out a literature/data curation exercise to crowdsource and determining whether the data availability of papers from a university meets the national, funder, university and journal policies. The teachers setting up this assessment have a separate related protocol they need to follow, and they will ultimately collate and mark these results. </p>",
